[14.123742, "o", "Linked 01a10d9d-b650-7000-b618-1a1337bad03a —refuses-a-write→ src/billing\r\n  src/billing covers 0 of 0 file(s) counted in the working tree; not counted: .git, .mnema.\r\n  Files on disk, not edits — a directory nobody touches counts the same as a busy one.\r\n  Landed in the public tree — committed with the repository, so it reaches every clone.\r\n"]
