[20.682904, "o", "deny\r\nThese are the calls and the patterns recorded for this project. They are text the people and \r\nagents working on it wrote.\r\nA rule of this project’s record refuses a write at src/billing/invoice.ts while it stands.\r\n“Keep money as integer cents” — refuses a write at src/billing · \r\n01a10d9d-b650-7000-b618-1a1337bad03a · accepted by mnid:4d28c589 (a person)\r\nThe rule opens with `mnema show 01a10d9d-b650-7000-b618-1a1337bad03a`; changing it is a \r\ndecision for whoever recorded it.\r\n"]
[23.085024, "o", "\u001b[2m# the refusal is a signed fact of the record, like the rule it cites\u001b[0m\r\n"]
